Package: vernissage
Title: Show Clinical Cohort Data at Their Best
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Clément", "Poupelin", , "clementjc.poupelin@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Preparation, description and visualisation of clinical cohort
    data in wide format (one row per subject, one column per variable and
    visit). Reads French-style CSV files, cleans names, reshapes visits,
    flags outliers with documented robust rules, chooses and applies power
    transformations, and describes the cohort with publication-ready
    'ggplot2' figures and 'gt' tables (cohort overview, distributions,
    missing-data maps, correlations, principal component analysis, paired
    visits, trajectories, radar and forest plots).
